    ["　　<InvDefault_HW>“如果你是来给我带来温暖的，那确实是我。”恢复了体温的戴莉在麋鹿的头顶蹦跶了几下，继续说道：“我叫戴莉， 你的名字是什么？”</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW> “我是……抱歉，我忘记了我的名字。”</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>戴莉这才注意到，麋鹿的角上挂着许多小木牌，上面写着“我叫邓恩”、我是森林的守护者”、“每天巡逻看谁需要帮助”……</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>“你叫邓恩，”戴莉轻声说，她听树洞里的松鼠一家提起过这头每到冬天就会失忆的麋鹿，曾一天给他们送了三次松子，“你是银雾森林的守护者。”</>"] = "　　<InvDefault_HW>\"If you've come to bring me warmth, then that is indeed me.\" Daly, having regained her body temperature, hopped a few times on the moose's head and continued, \"My name is Daly. What is your name?\"</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW> \"I am... I'm sorry, I have forgotten my name.\"</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>Only then did Daly notice that many small wooden plaques were hanging on the moose's antlers, with words written on them like \"My name is Dunn,\" \"I am the Guardian of the forest,\" \"Patrol every day to see who needs help\"...</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>\"Your name is Dunn,\" Daly said softly. She had heard the squirrel family in the tree hole mention this moose that would lose its memory every winter, having once delivered pine nuts to them three times in a single day, \"You are the Guardian of the Silver Mist Forest.\"</>",
